{"id":"n21268-2-7","stage":2,"title":"불어오다 · (喻义)吹起","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n21268-2-7-1","ko":"새로운 사장님이 오셨대.","zh":"听说来了新的老板。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"새로운","meaning":"新","explanation":"새롭다：新；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"새롭다","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29029","senseId":"1","lemma":"새롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사장님이","meaning":"老板，总经理","explanation":"사장：老板，总经理；님：尊称后缀。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사장","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61274","senseId":"1","lemma":"사장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"오셨대.","meaning":"来，传来","explanation":"오다：来，传来；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"오다","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69514","senseId":"6","lemma":"오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0dd73a3ec7854899","term":"새롭다","zh":"新","audio":"/audio/0dd73a3ec78548995542.mp3","entryId":"29029","definition":"与至今为止的东西不同或不曾存在过。","pronunciation":["새롭따"]},{"id":"ede38c8825edb7fb","term":"사장","zh":"老板，总经理","audio":"/audio/ede38c8825edb7fbd7e4.mp3","entryId":"61274","definition":"代表公司对公司事务负责的人。","pronunciation":["사장"]},{"id":"6fe577b99594f4a7","term":"오다","zh":"来，传来","audio":"/audio/6fe577b99594f4a7bd8d.mp3","entryId":"69514","definition":"消息或联系等被转达给某人。","pronunciation":["오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/05e0fc3e9feb7d691519.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n21268-2-7-2","ko":"회사에 변화의 바람이 불어오겠구나.","zh":"公司里要迎来变革的风潮了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회사에","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"변화의","meaning":"变化","explanation":"변화：变化；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"변화","audio":"/audio/d06231d77cebc3d059aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"83169","senseId":"1","lemma":"변화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"바람이","meaning":"风，潮","explanation":"바람：风，潮；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"바람","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85627","senseId":"4","lemma":"바람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불어오겠구나.","meaning":"(喻义)吹起，刮起","explanation":"불어오다：(喻义)吹起，刮起；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"불어오다","audio":"/audio/c2bbcd80891500ee519b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"21268","senseId":"2","lemma":"불어오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"d06231d77cebc3d0","term":"변화","zh":"变化","audio":"/audio/d06231d77cebc3d059aa.mp3","entryId":"83169","definition":"某物的样子、状态或性质等变得不同。","pronunciation":["변ː화"]},{"id":"9ec024bb0ceb6fd2","term":"바람","zh":"风，潮","audio":"/audio/9ec024bb0ceb6fd21e9a.mp3","entryId":"85627","definition":"社会上短暂时间内产生的流行、氛围或思想上的倾向。","pronunciation":["바람"]},{"id":"c2bbcd80891500ee","term":"불어오다","zh":"(喻义)吹起，刮起","audio":"/audio/c2bbcd80891500ee519b.mp3","entryId":"21268","definition":"倾向或流行等带来影响。","pronunciation":["부러오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1a2d68fac5f74f91a016.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.874,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=21268","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":67,"sequenceScore":1.7007,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["公司里要迎来变革的风潮了。","听说来了新的老板。","您信仰什么宗教呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["听说来了新的老板。","您信仰什么宗教呢？","公司里要迎来变革的风潮了。"],"answer":2}]}
